Decisions — Week 1
Decision 1: Programming Language

Problem: Which programming language should be used for the project?
Options:
Java (recommended by faculty)
C 

Discussion: Java was already the suggested language for this project. It also makes it easier to represent things like Registers, Memory, PCB, and Scheduler as separate classes since Java is object-oriented, and it has built-in data structures (Queue, Stack, LinkedList) useful for process management.

Decision: Java is finalized as the programming language for this project.
